{
  "slug": "ai-memory-reader",
  "name": "Ai Memory Reader",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Adds /aimr slash command that opens CLAUDE.md and other AI agent memory files in AI Memory Reader — a free open-source native macOS & iOS app with markdown rendering, file tree, in-page find, and edit mode. Complements the internal claude-md-management plugin (which writes/improves CLAUDE.md) by providing a polished native viewer.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 command**, `aimr` (Open the project's CLAUDE.md (or a specified memory file) in AI Memory Reader — the native macOS/iOS viewer…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install ai-memory-reader@claude-community` from `nvwalj/aimr-claude-plugin`.",
